{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他正舒服地停留在这份亲近里，像刚说完一句重要的话，还沉浸在余味中发愣。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"喜欢、舒服、亲近、余韵中的发愣\",\n      \"missed\": \"右上角的“心动却不敢说”“靠近了又舍不得”比较小，容易漏掉；下方水波、暗流、声音滞留、破碎倒影的具体画面需要逐句读才能理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他仍然沉在亲近和重要话语说完后的余味里，期间有短促、急切的声音突然冒出来，又很快沉下去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"喜欢、舒服、余韵、隐约急切、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的“持续摇曳中忽然冒出几句短促、急切的声音”需要仔细读才能完整抓到；下方水波、暗流、倒影的长段描写包含多层画面，一眼不容易串联。右上角两条情绪标签也容易漏。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他还停留在亲近带来的满足和余韵里，刚说过重要的话，情绪中又有短暂急切、随后沉下去的波动。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"喜欢、舒服、亲近、余韵、急切、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"与第2张相同，短促声音出现又消退的过程，以及水波被暗流拖住、思绪像破碎倒影的具体关系，需要逐句阅读才能理解；右上角的小标签不容易成为第一眼注意点。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"最影响扫读的是情绪补充和具体画面的注意力分配不够理想：最关键的“心动却不敢说”“靠近了又舍不得”放在右上角的小字里，而下方较长的水波、暗流、声音、倒影描写占据了更多视觉空间。第一眼能抓到他喜欢这份亲近、说完重要的话还在回味，但不一定马上抓到“不敢说”和“舍不得”，也不一定能确定下方几层画面都在表现同一个人的情绪。整体能串起来，但需要进一步阅读才能完整确认。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a471de1f-b8de-4231-9fbf-bb9fce8c05df", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T005333607301Z", "elapsed_seconds": 59.688, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:54:33.293418+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "18307a40e50666e5778de136b3e5fd2f5a80f7372b92a40d903502955e7550a8", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T005333607301Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "edb6e57ab8c14fd12a6d3ddab5143e64e509817ef072312c799578837cff523e"}}}
